---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const offers=[
['KEYNOTE SPEAKING','Bring a message into the room.','For event organizers, teams, schools, and communities. Shape a keynote around your audience, occasion, and the conversation you want to open.','/services/speaking/','Explore keynote speaking'],
['COACHING','Develop your voice and direction.','For people clarifying a message, preparing to speak, or deciding what comes next. Work directly with Loren on your goals and next steps.','/services/coaching/','Explore coaching'],
['KEYNOTE WRITING','Give your ideas a clear structure.','For leaders and speakers with an important talk ahead. Develop your ideas, stories, and draft into a keynote that sounds like you.','/services/keynote-writing/','Explore keynote writing'],
['THE MINDSET REVOLUTION','A structured twelve-week experience.','12 self-paced classes in the first four weeks, with 12 private, 60-minute coaching calls across twelve weeks. Explore your perspective, purpose, and next steps.','/the-mindset-revolution/','Explore the program']];
---
<Base title="Work with Loren" description="Find the right support: keynote speaking, personal coaching, keynote writing, or the twelve-week Mindset Revolution program."><section class="section wrap service-overview-intro"><p class="eyebrow">WORK WITH LOREN</p><h1>Find the right support.</h1><p class="section-aside">Choose the kind of support you need. Each path explains who it serves, how the work begins, and what to do next.</p></section><section class="wrap service-choices">{offers.map(([label,title,body,href,action])=><article class="service-choice"><p class="eyebrow">{label}</p><h2>{title}</h2><p>{body}</p><a class="text-link" href={href}>{action} ↗</a></article>)}</section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Not sure where to begin?</h2><p>Tell Loren what you are working toward. Start with a general inquiry and explore which path fits.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/testimonials/">Hear client experiences ↗</a></div></section></Base>
